构"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表现"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "句法"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0001>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "fpqc topology", "target_term": "fpqc拓扑"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "句法"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0002>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n确实，由于同构（isomorphisms）总是覆盖（coverings），我们可知（或要求）性质<MATH_0001>对<MATH_0002>成立，当且仅当它对任意概形（scheme）<MATH_0003>成立，其中该概形与<MATH_0004>同构（isomorphic）。事实上，若<MATH_0005>或<MATH_0006>，那么只要<MATH_0007>具有<MATH_0008>，且<MATH_0009>是平坦（flat）的、平坦（flat）且局部有限表现（locally of finite presentation）的、句法（syntomic）的、光滑（smooth）的、平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）的或开浸入（open immersion），就有<MATH_0010>具有<MATH_0011>。这是因为我们总能把<MATH_0012>扩充为一个<MATH_0013>-覆盖（covering）。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n有以下蕴含关系：\n<MATH_0014>在fpqc拓扑（fpqc topology）中是局部（local）的\n<MATH_0015>\n<MATH_0016>在fppf拓扑（topology）中是局部（local）的\n<MATH_0017>\n<MATH_0018>在句法（syntomic）拓扑（topology）中是局部（local）的\n<MATH_0019>\n<MATH_0020>在光滑（smooth）拓扑（topology）中是局部（local）的\n<MATH_0021>\n<MATH_0022>在平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）拓扑（topology）中是局部（local）的\n<MATH_0023>\n<MATH_0024>在Zariski拓扑（topology）中是局部（local）的。\n这由《拓扑（Topologies）》引理<REF_0001>、<REF_0002>、<REF_0003>、<REF_0004>及<REF_0005>推出。\n\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:497b4a5de60d6c22d9b57f754c162e8945ff6a5cb081af5ddae808fecd4c6ff4", "unit_id": "tag:0347:prose-0002", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "同构作为覆盖，译法待决。", "source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"context": "拓扑覆盖，译法待决。", "source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"context": "同构不变的性质所作用的对象，译法待决。", "source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "概形之间的同构，译法待决。", "source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}, {"context": "相应拓扑允许的态射条件，译法待决。", "source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"context": "fppf情形的态射条件，译法待决。", "source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表现"}, {"context": "syntomic暂定名称，待决。", "source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "句法"}, {"context": "光滑态射与光滑拓扑，译法待决。", "source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"context": "态射的平展条件，译法待决。", "source_term": "<ACCENT_0001>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"context": "Zariski情形的态射条件，译法待决。", "source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"context": "可扩充所得的覆盖，译法待决。", "source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"context": "蕴含链中的fpqc拓扑，译法待决。", "source_term": "fpqc topology", "target_term": "fpqc拓扑"}, {"context": "性质的拓扑局部性，译法待决。", "source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部"}, {"context": "各个拓扑中的局部性，译法待决。", "source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"context": "蕴含链中的平展拓扑，译法待决。", "source_term": "<ACCENT_0002>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"context": "引用的章节名称，译法待决。", "source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑"}]}
